Package: pnetr
Title: Photosynthetic and Evapotranspiration Model Family in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Xiaojie", "Gao", email = "xj.gao.gis@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Xiaojie Gao [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Xiaojie Gao <xj.gao.gis@outlook.com>
Description: Implements the Photosynthetic and EvapoTranspiration (PnET)
    family of forest ecosystem models, including PnET-II, PnET-Day, and
    PnET-CN. The models simulate forest carbon, water, and nitrogen cycling
    in response to climate and site conditions.
